# 0.2 (`GENRE-NODE-SPELLING`): under `statechart` a node is a `state` and a connector
# is a `transition`. Both renames are scoped by the header genre.
figdown 0.2 statechart
title "Turnstile"
class mode "A mode" fill=#e0e7ff
state locked "LOCKED" class=mode
state unlocked "UNLOCKED" class=mode
transition locked -[coin]-> unlocked
transition unlocked -[push]-> locked
rank locked,unlocked
flow right
